────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
3. SCOPE NOTE (read once)
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

The corpus translations are original LSI work. Everything in this
repository belongs to the two open levels of The Living Atlas:
direct applications of published, peer-reviewed methodology against
gray-zone benchmark-register questions.

The Phoenix Corpus — LSI's extended research collection, covering
hybrid language forms, stacked signals and tuned composition — is
not in this repository and never will be. It is packaged separately
and described openly rather than withheld: ask us about any of it.
The licensed corpus is the territory; this pack is the atlas.
